  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spinalis is developing a center for SCI Rehab patients at the Central Hospital in Windhoek. Bridging objectives are a dialogue for a        national policy for acute rehab of SCI patients and to perform an     integrated medical team of SCI personel at the central hospital</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Spinalis ska utveckla ett nationellt centrum, en klinik, f&#xf6;r SCI      Rehab av patienter p&#xe5; centralsjukhuset i Windhoek. &#xd6;verbryggande m&#xe5;l  &#xe4;r satta; en dialog avseende nationell policy f&#xf6;r v&#xe5;rd ac SCI         patienter &#xe4;r initierad och att s&#xe4;tta samman ett fungerande integrerat team SCI personal p&#xe5; Centralsjukhuset i Windhoek</narrative>
